    "intro": [
      "Radicals can only be added or subtracted when they have the **same radicand**.",
      "When multiplying radicals, multiply the numbers outside and inside the radical, then simplify.",
      "To simplify a radical, look for perfect-square factors inside the radical.",
      "Always rewrite the final answer in simplest radical form."
    ]
